  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Childhood Development Activity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">the collaboration was formed to increase access to, and improve the quality of, pre-primary and primary education at the country level, particularly in conflict and crisis contexts. although this activity will focus on early learning, additional nutritional, health and child safety, responsive caregiving, programs may be provided within health, idp and school centers.</narrative>
  </description>
